ustrations of the Good Samaritan and Abraham's offering of Isaac.\",\"measurableVerb\":\"identify\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"75201c02-1f3b-7394-87bf-b0b881063efb\",\"840ff55a-7674-794a-9647-bfdcbb4d1f63\",\"8ebf28eb-e65d-72d1-b81f-d44070a45818\",\"a3ea6e62-8a7f-719f-b99a-a993e3d4ddae\",\"91ec572c-9242-737d-b80e-689ef93077b9\",\"f854e275-2499-7853-92af-cea1314dce65\",\"c7ee7328-781f-7b6e-a93d-dd1bdaa2b069\",\"9c8ccd05-72d7-768b-9a4b-cd41813e3158\"],\"confidence\":0.9},{\"statement\":\"Apply t","he gift-versus-harvest framework to the life of a Christian believer by describing how visible works function as the indistinguishable fruit of a relationship with God rather than as a prerequisite for it.\",\"measurableVerb\":\"apply\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"a4e0b144-3c02-733c-a1f1-8de6f04f39a7\",\"e147175f-4e18-768e-8087-df130de3689b\",\"04360068-2f11-7415-a410-5834e33afc74\",\"9c8ccd05-72d7-768b-9a4b-cd41813e3158\"],\"confidence\":0.85}],\"keyConcepts\":[{\"concept\":\"Two manifestations of righteousness: divine gift and harvest of obedience\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"92b36f9c-4010-7482-97b9-74dba2360041\",\"a4e0b144-3c02-733c-a1f1-8de6f04f39a7\"]},{\"concept\":\"Sowing and reaping: generosity and the harvest of righteousness (2 Corinthians 9:6–10)\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"c0a8a43c-a6b9-7a41-a68a-bcb11ff45d2c\"]},{\"concept\":\"Seed origin: righteousness begins as God's gift but must be planted in practical obedience\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"e147175f-4e18-768e-8087-df130de3689b\"]},{\"concept\":\"Vertical righteousness before God versus horizontal righteousness before men\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"04360068-2f11-7415-a410-5834e33afc74\"]},{\"concept\":\"Tzedakah and its three dimensions: personal morality, justice, and charity\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"75201c02-1f3b-7394-87bf-b0b881063efb\",\"8ebf28eb-e65d-72d1-b81f-d44070a45818\",\"91ec572c-9242-737d-b80e-689ef93077b9\",\"c7ee7328-781f-7b6e-a93d-dd1bdaa2b069\"]}],\"prerequisiteKnowledge\":[{\"item\":\"Working familiarity with the idea that righteousness is received from God as a gift by believers\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"92b36f9c-4010-7482-97b9-74dba2360041\"]},{\"item\":\"Basic acquaintance with biblical figures and passages referenced: Adam's garden, David and Goliath, the Good Samaritan, and Abraham offering Isaac\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"e147175f-4e18-768e-8087-df130de3689b\",\"04360068-2f11-7415-a410-5834e33afc74\",\"f854e275-2499-7853-92af-cea1314dce65\",\"9c8ccd05-72d7-768b-9a4b-cd41813e3158\"]}],\"vocabulary\":[{\"term\":\"Righteousness as gift\",\"definition\":\"The righteousness given by God to all who believe, r","eceived apart from human effort.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"a4e0b144-3c02-733c-a1f1-8de6f04f39a7\"]},{\"term\":\"Righteousness as harvest\",\"definition\":\"Righteousness produced on account of obedience—the fruit, not the prerequisite, of a relationship with God.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"a4e0b144-3c02-733c-a1f1-8de6f04f39a7\",\"c0a8a43c-a6b9-7a41-a68a-bcb11ff45d2c\"]},{\"term\":\"Sowing and reaping\",\"definition\":\"The principle that one reaps in proportion to how one sows, applied to cheerful giving and its harvest of righteousness.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"c0a8a43c-a6b9-7a41-a68a-bcb11ff45d2c\"]},{\"term\":\"Tzedakah\",\"definition\":\"The Hebrew word for righteousness, encompassing personal morality, justice, and charity.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"75201c02-1f3b-7394-87bf-b0b881063efb\",\"840ff55a-7674-794a-9647-bfdcbb4d1f63\"]},{\"term\":\"Vertical righteousness\",\"definition\":\"Standing before God, where human efforts are like filthy rags and crowns are cast down at the throne.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"04360068-2f11-7415-a410-5834e33afc74\"]},{\"term\":\"Horizontal righteousness\",\"definition\":\"Standing before men, where faith is seen only through visible works.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"04360068-2f11-7415-a410-5834e33afc74\"]}],\"misconceptions\":[{\"misconception\":\"Righteousness is only ever God's gift and never anything a believer produces.\",\"correction\":\"The lesson presents two manifestations: the gift all believers receive, and a harvest of righteousness that comes on account of obedience.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"92b36f9c-4010-7482-97b9-74dba2360041\",\"a4e0b144-3c02-733c-a1f1-8de6f04f39a7\"]},{\"misconception\":\"Harvest-righteousness earned by works is a prerequisite for a relationship with God.\",\"correction\":\"It is not a prerequisite but an indistinguishable fruit of the relationship with God.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"a4e0b144-3c02-733c-a1f1-8de6f04f39a7\"]},{\"misconception\":\"Positional or ceremonial righteousness before others is sufficient without active justice or generosity.\",\"correction\":\"The Good Samaritan illustration shows religious l","eaders had positional and ceremonial righteousness but lacked active justice, and tzedakah includes justice and charity.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"f854e275-2499-7853-92af-cea1314dce65\",\"91ec572c-9242-737d-b80e-689ef93077b9\",\"c7ee7328-781f-7b6e-a93d-dd1bdaa2b069\"]}],\"assessmentQuestions\":[{\"question\":\"Name and describe the two manifestations of righteousness, and state how the second relates to the believer's relationship with God.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"a4e0b144-3c02-733c-a1f1-8de6f04f39a7\",\"92b36f9c-4010-7482-97b9-74dba2360041\"]},{\"question\":\"According to 2 Corinthians 9:6–10, what does God supply and multiply, and what does He increase as a result?\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"c0a8a43c-a6b9-7a41-a68a-bcb11ff45d2c\"]},{\"question\":\"Using David's example, explain the difference between vertical righteousness before God and horizontal righteousness before men.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"04360068-2f11-7415-a410-5834e33afc74\"]},{\"question\":\"List the three dimensions of tzedakah and give the biblical illustration the lesson provides for justice and for charity.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"75201c02-1f3b-7394-87bf-b0b881063efb\",\"a3ea6e62-8a7f-719f-b99a-a993e3d4ddae\",\"f854e275-2499-7853-92af-cea1314dce65\",\"9c8ccd05-72d7-768b-9a4b-cd41813e3158\"]},{\"question\":\"Why does the lesson say Adam's garden shows that righteousness begins as a gift yet still requires planting?\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"e147175f-4e18-768e-8087-df130de3689b\"]}],\"focusCoverage\":{\"status\":\"covered\"}}"],"textChunksTruncated":false,"textCharacters":7444,"reasoningCharacters":0,"finishReason":"stop","inputTokens":"[REDACTED]","outputTokens":"[REDACTED]"},"retries":0,"latencyMs":50757,"service":"pipeline-worker","correlationId":"01a15340-392d-7857-963f-cdd8411984c1"}}
