{"timestamp":"2026-10-19T09:16:25.762Z","level":"info","event":"queue.job_dispatched","fields":{"outboxEventId":"01a15372-9ac5-7d42-8ab4-985147eeb43f","jobId":"01a15372-9ac5-7f00-a908-ff8351608f40","projectId":"01a1533e-89c7-7f2d-8eb8-752502c8023b","correlationId":"01a15340-392d-7857-963f-cdd8411984c1","queueName":"orchestration","service":"pipeline-worker"}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-19T09:16:29.019Z","level":"info","event":"provider.together.response","fields":{"provider":"together","endpoint":"/chat/completions","response":{"httpStatus":200,"contentType":"text/event-stream","providerRequestId":"fe8b98a7-aws_ec1","model":"moonshotai/Kimi-K3","text":"{\"schemaVersion\":\"narration-v1\",\"targetDurationSeconds\":180,\"blocks\":[{\"outlineItemId\":\"01a15371-a6dd-7fa3-85ef-0d53b5a8a5d8\",\"sentences\":[{\"text\":\"Most of us in the church were taught that righteousness is God's gift, and that is absolutely true.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"92b36f9c-4010-7482-97b9-74dba2360041\"]},{\"text\":\"But Scripture also speaks of a righteousness that grows as a harvest from the things we actually do.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"92b36f9c-4010-7482-97b9-74dba2360041\"]},{\"text\":\"So what are these different manifestations, and how do they apply to you as a believer?\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"92b36f9c-4010-7482-97b9-74dba2360041\"]}]},{\"outlineItemId\":\"01a15371-a6dd-7a85-85cf-ccb6d834c041\",\"sentences\":[{\"text\":\"Here is the core distinction: righteousness shows up in two manifestations.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"a4e0b144-3c02-733c-a1f1-8de6f04f39a7\"]},{\"text\":\"The first is righteousness given by God as a gift, available to everyone who believes.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"a4e0b144-3c02-733c-a1f1-8de6f04f39a7\"]},{\"text\":\"The second is righteousness as a harvest, and that one rests on account of your obedience.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"a4e0b144-3c02-733c-a1f1-8de6f04f39a7\"]},{\"text\":\"Now hear this carefully: the harvest is never a prerequisite to your relationship with God.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"a4e0b144-3c02-733c-a1f1-8de6f04f39a7\"]},{\"text\":\"It is the indistinguishable fruit of that relationship, the visible evidence that the relationship is real.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"a4e0b144-3c02-733c-a1f1-8de6f04f39a7\"]}]},{\"outlineItemId\":\"01a15371-a6dd-7378-a81f-8f399d11b972\",\"sentences\":[{\"text\":\"Paul states the principle plainly: \\\"whoever sows sparingly will also reap sparingly, and whoever sows bountifully will also reap bountifully.\\\"\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"c0a8a43c-a6b9-7a41-a68a-bcb11ff45d2c\"],\"quotation\":true},{\"text\":\"Each person gives as decided in the heart, because God loves a cheerful giver, not a reluctant one.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"c0a8a43c-a6b9-7a41-a68a-bcb11ff45d2c\"]},{\"text\":\"And God is able","textChunks":["{\"schemaVersion\":\"narration-v1\",\"targetDurationSeconds\":180,\"blocks\":[{\"outlineItemId\":\"01a15371-a6dd-7fa3-85ef-0d53b5a8a5d8\",\"sentences\":[{\"text\":\"Most of us in the church were taught that righteousness is God's gift, and that is absolutely true.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"92b36f9c-4010-7482-97b9-74dba2360041\"]},{\"text\":\"But Scripture also speaks of a righteousness that grows as a harvest from the things we actually do.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"92b36f9c-4010-7482-97b9-74dba2360041\"]},{\"text\":\"So what are these different manifestations, and how do they apply to you as a believer?\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"92b36f9c-4010-7482-97b9-74dba2360041\"]}]},{\"outlineItemId\":\"01a15371-a6dd-7a85-85cf-ccb6d834c041\",\"sentences\":[{\"text\":\"Here is the core distinction: righteousness shows up in two manifestations.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"a4e0b144-3c02-733c-a1f1-8de6f04f39a7\"]},{\"text\":\"The first is righteousness given by God as a gift, available to everyone who believes.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"a4e0b144-3c02-733c-a1f1-8de6f04f39a7\"]},{\"text\":\"The second is righteousness as a harvest, and that one rests on account of your obedience.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"a4e0b144-3c02-733c-a1f1-8de6f04f39a7\"]},{\"text\":\"Now hear this carefully: the harvest is never a prerequisite to your relationship with God.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"a4e0b144-3c02-733c-a1f1-8de6f04f39a7\"]},{\"text\":\"It is the indistinguishable fruit of that relationship, the visible evidence that the relationship is real.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"a4e0b144-3c02-733c-a1f1-8de6f04f39a7\"]}]},{\"outlineItemId\":\"01a15371-a6dd-7378-a81f-8f399d11b972\",\"sentences\":[{\"text\":\"Paul states the principle plainly: \\\"whoever sows sparingly will also reap sparingly, and whoever sows bountifully will also reap bountifully.\\\"\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"c0a8a43c-a6b9-7a41-a68a-bcb11ff45d2c\"],\"quotation\":true},{\"text\":\"Each person gives as decided in the heart, because God loves a cheerful giver, not a reluctant one.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"c0a8a43c-a6b9-7a41-a68a-bcb11ff45d2c\"]},{\"text\":\"And God is able"," to make all grace abound to you, so that having all sufficiency you may abound in every good work.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"c0a8a43c-a6b9-7a41-a68a-bcb11ff45d2c\"]},{\"text\":\"Then Paul says God will multiply your seed for sowing and increase the harvest of your righteousness.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"c0a8a43c-a6b9-7a41-a68a-bcb11ff45d2c\"]},{\"text\":\"Notice what that means: generosity is a practical demonstration of righteousness in action.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"c0a8a43c-a6b9-7a41-a68a-bcb11ff45d2c\"]}]},{\"outlineItemId\":\"01a15371-a6dd-7ba4-8981-9cf769bae3bd\",\"sentences\":[{\"text\":\"Trace the seed back through the generations and you reach Adam, who woke up in a garden planted by God Himself.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"e147175f-4e18-768e-8087-df130de3689b\"]},{\"text\":\"Righteousness begins as a divine gift, the seed, but that seed must be planted in the soil of practical obedience to produce a crop.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"e147175f-4e18-768e-8087-df130de3689b\"]},{\"text\":\"Now hold two directions in view.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"04360068-2f11-7415-a410-5834e33afc74\"]},{\"text\":\"Vertically, before God, all our human efforts are like filthy rags.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"04360068-2f11-7415-a410-5834e33afc74\"]},{\"text\":\"Horizontally, before people, faith can only be seen through visible works.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"04360068-2f11-7415-a410-5834e33afc74\"]},{\"text\":\"Watch David: facing Goliath, he spoke of covenant privilege.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"04360068-2f11-7415-a410-5834e33afc74\"]},{\"text\":\"But before King Saul, he presented a practical resume: the lion and the bear.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"04360068-2f11-7415-a410-5834e33afc74\"]}]},{\"outlineItemId\":\"01a15371-a6dd-7953-97e6-c23a991ee8e0\",\"sentences\":[{\"text\":\"The Hebrew word for this is tzedakah, and it carries three distinct dimensions in Scripture.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"75201c02-1f3b-7394-87bf-b0b881063efb\",\"840ff55a-7674-794a-9647-bfdcbb4d1f63\"]},{\"text\":\"First, personal morality: adhering to moral conduct, avoiding sin, and keeping personal purity.\",\"sourceBlockIds\"",":[\"8ebf28eb-e65d-72d1-b81f-d44070a45818\",\"a3ea6e62-8a7f-719f-b99a-a993e3d4ddae\"]},{\"text\":\"Second, justice: standing up for the oppressed and the vulnerable.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"91ec572c-9242-737d-b80e-689ef93077b9\",\"f854e275-2499-7853-92af-cea1314dce65\"]},{\"text\":\"Think of the Good Samaritan: the religious leaders had positional and ceremonial righteousness, yet they lacked active justice.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"f854e275-2499-7853-92af-cea1314dce65\"]},{\"text\":\"Third, charity: being rich toward God and caring for the needy.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"c7ee7328-781f-7b6e-a93d-dd1bdaa2b069\",\"9c8ccd05-72d7-768b-9a4b-cd41813e3158\"]},{\"text\":\"Abraham was justified by faith, but when he offered Isaac his faith was perfected by works, and God said, \\\"Now I know.\\\"\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"9c8ccd05-72d7-768b-9a4b-cd41813e3158\"],\"quotation\":true}]},{\"outlineItemId\":\"01a15371-a6dd-7a01-852a-bdf8dfdce0b3\",\"sentences\":[{\"text\":\"So here is the picture applied to you: you receive the gift, the seed, freely from God.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"e147175f-4e18-768e-8087-df130de3689b\"]},{\"text\":\"You plant that seed in the soil of practical obedience.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"e147175f-4e18-768e-8087-df130de3689b\"]},{\"text\":\"The visible works that grow are the crop, the indistinguishable fruit of your relationship with God, never the price of admission into it.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"a4e0b144-3c02-733c-a1f1-8de6f04f39a7\"]},{\"text\":\"Ask yourself today: where does my seed still need planting?\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[],\"generatedAddition\":{\"kind\":\"clarification\",\"rationale\":\"The outline explicitly directs the narrator to invite learners to identify where their own seed needs planting; this applies the source framework without adding new theological claims.\"}}]},{\"outlineItemId\":\"01a15371-a6dd-75a7-8cc7-cab89f6efdfc\",\"sentences\":[{\"text\":\"Righteousness is both God's gift to all who believe and a harvest produced through obedience.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"a4e0b144-3c02-733c-a1f1-8de6f04f39a7\"]},{\"text\":\"It is vertical before God a","nd horizontal before people, spanning morality, justice, and charity.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"04360068-2f11-7415-a410-5834e33afc74\",\"840ff55a-7674-794a-9647-bfdcbb4d1f63\"]},{\"text\":\"Your works are the fruit of the relationship, never the prerequisite.\",\"sourceBlockIds\":[\"a4e0b144-3c02-733c-a1f1-8de6f04f39a7\"]}]}]}"],"textChunksTruncated":false,"textCharacters":6311,"reasoningCharacters":0,"finishReason":"stop","inputTokens":"[REDACTED]","outputTokens":"[REDACTED]"},"retries":0,"latencyMs":40304,"service":"pipeline-worker","correlationId":"01a15340-392d-7857-963f-cdd8411984c1"}}
